137
00:05:08,874 --> 00:05:10,989
The Americans had built their bomb in

138
00:05:11,009 --> 00:05:12,259
secret, at Los Alamos.

139
00:05:12,829 --> 00:05:14,776
Now the question was who had carried its

140
00:05:14,796 --> 00:05:15,366
secrets out.

141
00:05:15,836 --> 00:05:17,845
And the answers were already sitting in

142
00:05:17,865 --> 00:05:18,730
