143
00:05:19,650 --> 00:05:21,840
The first name to fall was a physicist.

144
00:05:22,460 --> 00:05:25,230
In 1949, two cover names in the messages,

145
00:05:25,250 --> 00:05:28,088
CHARLES and REST, were identified as Klaus

146
00:05:28,108 --> 00:05:28,496
