147
00:05:28,966 --> 00:05:31,165
One message, the official VENONA history

148
00:05:31,185 --> 00:05:33,161
says, quoted a paper he had written.

149
00:05:33,732 --> 00:05:35,978
Fuchs, the FBI says, was a member of a

150
00:05:35,998 --> 00:05:38,482
British team working with the Americans on

151
00:05:38,502 --> 00:05:40,152
the atom bomb at Los Alamos.

152
00:05:40,721 --> 00:05:43,534
This message, from November 1944, shows

153
00:05:43,554 --> 00:05:45,567
