156
00:05:49,550 --> 00:05:52,139
CHARLES, it reports, had not left for the

157
00:05:52,159 --> 00:05:54,748
ISLAND, the KGB's word for Great Britain.

158
00:05:55,331 --> 00:05:56,849
He was at Camp No. 2.

159
00:05:57,432 --> 00:05:59,368
And he had promised to come on leave for

160
00:05:59,388 --> 00:05:59,857
