161
00:06:00,427 --> 00:06:02,361
British authorities questioned Fuchs.

162
00:06:02,831 --> 00:06:05,848
On January 24, 1950, he confessed.

163
00:06:06,418 --> 00:06:08,530
He was arrested on February 2, and

164
00:06:08,550 --> 00:06:09,910
sentenced to 14 years.

165
00:06:10,380 --> 00:06:12,386
The maximum under Britain's Official

166
00:06:12,406 --> 00:06:13,061
Secrets Act.

167
00:06:13,531 --> 00:06:15,476
According to accounts cited in the

168
00:06:15,496 --> 00:06:17,845
official VENONA history, Moscow had begun

169
00:06:17,865 --> 00:06:20,041
advising American agents who had dealt

170
00:06:20,061 --> 00:06:22,295
