180
00:06:44,327 --> 00:06:45,616
And a Soviet agent.

181
00:06:46,186 --> 00:06:48,142
In VENONA, he had a cover name too.

182
00:06:48,612 --> 00:06:50,866
This message from November 14 says his

183
00:06:50,886 --> 00:06:53,260
