00:10:21,743 --> 00:10:24,066
Once the spies were identified, the FBI

278
00:10:24,086 --> 00:10:26,409
had to develop the evidence about their

279
00:10:26,429 --> 00:10:26,829
crimes.

280
00:10:27,399 --> 00:10:28,912
They pointed to Klaus Fuchs.

281
00:10:29,382 --> 00:10:31,326
And the investigation that followed

282
00:10:31,346 --> 00:10:33,121
reached Gold, Greenglass and the

283
00:10:33,141 --> 00:10:33,738
Rosenbergs.

284
00:10:34,308 --> 00:10:36,527
But the same secret that caught them also

285
00:10:36,547 --> 00:10:38,002
kept one case out of court.

286
00:10:38,585 --> 00:10:41,395
The 19-year-old in the November 1944

287
00:10:41,415 --> 00:10:43,517
telegram was never charged.

288
00:10:44,087 --> 00:10:45,957
Every secret has a release date.

289
00:10:46,540 --> 00:10:48,781
For VENONA, it came about half a century

290
00:10:48,801 --> 00:10:50,421
after the messages were sent.

291
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:53,200
If there's a government file you want us

292
00:10:53,220 --> 00:10:54,833
to open, tell us in the comments.

293
00:10:55,403 --> 00:10:57,705
Next time: another file, released in full.
